  "channel": "rent",
  "description": "*** To arrange a viewing or enquire about this property, please click on the \"Enquire Now\" or \"Get In Touch\" button on the listing.<br/>*** If you are attending a home open please register so you can be updated on any changes to days/times or cancellations.<br/><br/><br/>Welcome to 18 Pender Lane, Eglinton - a beautifully presented home offering comfortable, low-maintenance living in a fantastic coastal location.<br/><br/>Featuring three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a double garage, this inviting property combines practical living with a light, neutral palette and a beautiful, uninterrupted outlook. The open-plan living and dining area creates a welcoming space to relax and unwind, while the private rear courtyard offers the perfect spot to enjoy your morning coffee or entertain friends.<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned to enjoy the best of coastal living, this home is close to beautiful beaches, local schools and public transport, making everyday living easy and convenient.<br/><br/>Whether you're looking for a comfortable place to call home or a low-maintenance lifestyle in a lovely location, this property is ready for you to move in and enjoy.<br/><br/>Property Features Include:<br/><br/>Three well-appointed bedrooms<br/>Two bathrooms<br/>Double garage with convenient rear laneway access<br/>Light-filled open-plan living and dining<br/>Neutral colour palette to complement any style<br/>Split-system air conditioning<br/>Ceiling fans for added comfort<br/>Private, low-maintenance rear courtyard<br/>Beautiful uninterrupted outlook<br/>Directly opposite the open green spaces of Roebuck Park<br/><br/>Enjoy the Eglinton Lifestyle<br/><br/>",
